00:11:58,881 --> 00:12:02,880
- Right, or, or was it,
or I am perfectionist?

249
00:12:02,881 --> 00:12:05,200
- Yeah, these, we can
see right through these.

250
00:12:05,201 --> 00:12:08,520
I mean, they're too
obvious and they're too silly.

251
00:12:08,521 --> 00:12:12,960
I mean, everyone has a weakness, so don't
try and turn it around into a strength.

252
00:12:12,961 --> 00:12:14,440
I just don't think that's a good idea.

253
00:12:14,441 --> 00:12:18,440
- Okay, so yeah, be sure to
stay away from these answers.

254
00:12:18,441 --> 00:12:23,240
But you can say anything, like in this
case, he has a problem with being on time.

255
00:12:23,241 --> 00:12:27,760
- Yeah, so be honest, say what
one of your greatest weaknesses are.

256
00:12:27,810 --> 00:12:32,000
But the key to making
this weakness look good

257
00:12:32,001 --> 00:12:36,280
is saying what you are
doing to solve this weakness.

258
00:12:36,281 --> 00:12:39,720
- Exactly, so really be truthful.

259
00:12:39,721 --> 00:12:42,240
Tell the interviewer
what you're not good at,

260
00:12:42,639 --> 00:12:45,080
'cause there's obviously
something that you're not good at.

261
00:12:45,081 --> 00:12:47,840
- Exactly, so you can
say, I am usually late,

262
00:12:47,841 --> 00:12:51,680
but I am getting more
organized, I'm doing a seminar.

263
00:12:51,681 --> 00:12:55,760
I, you know, let the interviewer know that
you are trying to improve this weakness.

264
00:12:55,761 --> 00:12:59,640
- Exactly, and be sure to also
think about your strength, right?

265
00:12:59,641 --> 00:13:04,200
- Yeah, be prepared to answer the
question, what is your greatest strength?

266
00:13:04,201 --> 00:13:07,440
- So, and again, when you're
talking about your strengths,

267
00:13:07,441 --> 00:13:12,000
be sure it's something more specific
than saying, oh, I'm very responsible.

268
00:13:12,001 --> 00:13:15,600
- Yeah, you know, want
to be as specific as you can.

269
00:13:15,601 --> 00:13:20,440
And again, give those examples, give
those successes, give those numbers.

270
00:13:20,441 --> 00:13:25,040
- Right, exactly, so think about your
weaknesses, think about your strengths.

271
00:13:25,041 --> 00:13:28,120
If you don't know them, ask
people to ask your colleagues

272
00:13:28,121 --> 00:13:30,280
or ask your friends, what do
you think is my greatest strength?

273
00:13:30,281 --> 00:13:32,280
Maybe you're a funny
person, that's a strength.

274
00:13:32,281 --> 00:13:33,281
- Yes.

275
